  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;.........(i)</p><p>Now&nbsp;integrating both side we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>so,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;....(ii)</p><p>Now from equation&nbsp;(i), we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>From equation (ii)&nbsp;we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>&nbsp;(In&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;In&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math>.</p>",
